docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-r3.log:1366:docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-r2.log:2413:docs/plans/entity-ui-wiring/review/codex-r2-raw.md-11-| H1 隐藏旧值骗绿 | **CONFIRMED_FIXED** | 编译侧与回放侧均限定被钉抽屉内 `.agent-bind-select__value:visible`，要求计数恰一且 `textContent` 精确等于目标值；否则硬阻断。`lib/compile-atoms.mjs:1157`、`lib/replay-actions.mjs:352`。 |
docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-r3.log:1417:docs/plans/agent-id-readback/review/sol-r2.log:2470:docs/plans/entity-ui-wiring/review/codex-r1-raw.md:118:所谓 replay 金牌只运行 `casey compile` 和 `compile --execute`，覆盖的是编译期采集。锁链金牌只调用 `checkReplayEntityAdmission`，验证浏览器启动准入，没有调用 `performAction`/`doBindAgent`。因此新加的实际回放分支没有验收覆盖，H1 也能在 4/4 GREEN 下漏过。
